{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u201cChymicalia - Change is Possible!\u201d</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So reads the glowing sign outside the suspicious door that just appeared out of nowhere between two boarded-up buildings on the rough side of town.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An ordinary Yorkshire town, like any other... but not for long.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Because Chymicalia is a sentient alchemy shop, roving across the cosmos, trapping one poor soul after another as its unwilling servant.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For the last ten years, that servant has been you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But now you\u2019re here, back in the town you thought you'd never see again, and maybe somehow, this time, things are going to change. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2287720/extras/af83f1699f3a3480a90681265c59cd84.poster.avif?t=1751735245\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2287720/extras/af83f1699f3a3480a90681265c59cd84.apng?t=1751735245\" class=\"bb_img\" alt=\"Three glowing potions on a wooden bench\" width=600 height=256 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Make potions! Make friends! Make terrible mistakes!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chymicalia is an alchemy sim with a choice-driven narrative, where you talk to customers, listen to their troubles and attempt to create a potion that will solve their problems. Or at least, give them different problems.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, Chymicalia is a sentient shop, with its own sinister agenda for its customers. Keeping everyone satisfied isn't going to be easy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Is change really possible, in this hopeless town? Can you really help any of these people change their lives?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And even if you do... who\u2019s going to help you change yours?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2287720?t=1751735245","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2287720/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1751735245","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2287720/0ec5cde22eaa0f1e4ef8c8e751bd8deabf3fae33/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1751735245","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2287720/0ec5cde22eaa0f1e4ef8c8e751bd8deabf3fae33/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1751735245","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Captions available","id":13},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Subtitle Options","id":65},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u201cChymicalia - Change is Possible!\u201d</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So reads the glowing sign outside the suspicious door that just appeared out of nowhere between two boarded-up buildings on the rough side of town.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An ordinary Yorkshire town, like any other... but not for long.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Because Chymicalia is a sentient alchemy shop, roving across the cosmos, trapping one poor soul after another as its unwilling servant.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For the last ten years, that servant has been you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But now you\u2019re here, back in the town you thought you'd never see again, and maybe somehow, this time, things are going to change. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2287720/extras/af83f1699f3a3480a90681265c59cd84.poster.avif?t=1751735245\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2287720/extras/af83f1699f3a3480a90681265c59cd84.apng?t=1751735245\" class=\"bb_img\" alt=\"Three glowing potions on a wooden bench\" width=600 height=256 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Make potions! Make friends! Make terrible mistakes!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chymicalia is an alchemy sim with a choice-driven narrative, where you talk to customers, listen to their troubles and attempt to create a potion that will solve their problems. Or at least, give them different problems.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, Chymicalia is a sentient shop, with its own sinister agenda for its customers. Keeping everyone satisfied isn't going to be easy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Is change really possible, in this hopeless town? Can you really help any of these people change their lives?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And even if you do... who\u2019s going to help you change yours?</p>","developers":["Falling Awkwardly"],"genres":[{